meta {
  name: Upload Avatar
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/avatar
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  file: @file(/path/to/avatar.jpg)
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/avatar

  Uploads a profile picture for the currently authenticated user.
  Accepts `multipart/form-data` with a single `file` field (JPEG/PNG, max 2MB).
  The image is stored in Supabase Storage and the URL is saved in the user's profile.

  ### Form Fields
  | Field | Type | Description                          |
  |-------|------|--------------------------------------|
  | file  | File | Image file (JPEG or PNG, max 2MB)    |

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  { "avatarUrl": "https://..." }
  ```
}
